{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在《今個夏天食平Ｄ》節目中，肥媽用鹹酸菜烹調豬頸肉，做出這道惹味的家常小菜「味菜豬頸肉」，做法簡單。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"20e709b0-35ff-4879-bd3d-1494771f73e7.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026oQiZf6RVFn1786524570.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"20e709b0-35ff-4879-bd3d-1494771f73e7.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>味菜豬頸肉食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">豬頸肉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">甘筍</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">芹菜</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">甜鹹酸菜</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>味菜豬頸肉做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3a259579-b039-41ef-bcb8-95a1c71cbf83.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026HLHiDS2oIl1786524570.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3a259579-b039-41ef-bcb8-95a1c71cbf83.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></